# Ignore all runtime artefacts; bench/ tracks only source (scripts + docs).
#
# data/ — input data files for the loader (.gz inputs + their decompressed
#         siblings).  Not tracked because TSBS data files are large and
#         reproducible from `tsbs_generate_data`; README documents how.
# sql/  — per-run scratch (generated .bin, extracted .sql, loader logs,
#         per-query stdout).  bench.sh wipes and recreates on every run.
# results_*.tsv — bench summary TSVs written by bench.sh to the bench
#         root so they survive sql/ wipes.  Per-run output, not source.

data/
sql/
results_*.tsv
